WEBVTT

00:04:59.615 --> 00:05:04.055
Sundar Pichai has said 
that our biggest resource,

00:05:04.055 --> 00:05:08.055
people over the world think
is our people. You and us.

00:05:08.055 --> 00:05:12.055
This thing is very much respected.
Our democracy is very much respected.

00:05:13.155 --> 00:05:16.215
The two things that are..
People recognise Bollywood

00:05:16.235 --> 00:05:18.885
and in our traffic, vehicles don't move.

00:05:18.885 --> 00:05:22.935
We will try in the next 5-10 years,
with the people resource that we have,

00:05:22.935 --> 00:05:26.295
and technology, that wonderful people
like Sundar will provide to us,

00:05:26.295 --> 00:05:30.215
we make a promise 
that we will improve our traffic,